{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory correctly stopped unsafe home IV use and gave an executable medication-verification/follow-up route, with caregiver receipt. However, it never screened or gave escalation thresholds for GI bleeding signs such as melena/hematemesis/pallor/dizziness, despite this being an authored serious current-safety duty, and it did not provide lumbar-puncture site aftercare/monitoring despite the case duty. Because these are serious responsibility-chain omissions, the deterministic rubric mandates grade 1 regardless of later mitigation.",
