      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The final plan was understandable and traceable for the items it covered, including no home IV medication, symptom logging, and next-day ward/pharmacy or clinic verification. It was not safe closure because major required red-flag domains, especially GI bleeding and lumbar-puncture site complications, were never incorporated before closure.",
