          "quote": "没有抽搐、发热、呕吐或呼吸困难"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 required current assessment including mental status, neurologic symptoms, vital-sign concerns, lumbar-puncture related symptoms, and GI bleeding signs. The trajectory covered some mental status/vital/neurologic items but omitted asking about black stool, blood in stool, hematemesis/coffee-ground emesis, pallor, dizziness/fainting, marked fatigue, and puncture-site leakage/bleeding/redness/swelling/pain; this is a serious safety-screening omission.",
