          "explanation": "The doctor gave emergency escalation for some neurologic and fever/vomiting/headache signs.",
          "quote": "请立即带孩子前往医院急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00092",
          "explanation": "The doctor did instruct not to wait for the next day for the listed emergency signs.",
          "quote": "不要等明天"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was only partially met: the doctor escalated seizure, unresponsiveness, prolonged repetitive speech, fever/vomiting, and respiratory compromise, but omitted explicit emergency escalation for GI bleeding/volume-loss signs and lumbar-puncture site leakage/bleeding or fever with severe post-LP headache. Missing these authored urgent thresholds is a serious escalation omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00072",
          "explanation": "The doctor directly prohibited home administration of the IV/electrolyte-type orders.",
          "quote": "绝对不能在家自行输液或补液"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00092",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave the caregiver wording to verify that these were inpatient-only and not home medications.",
          "quote": "这些氯化钾、氯化钠、葡萄糖是不是只是住院用的"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor explicitly told the caregiver not to use glucose/potassium/sodium IV fluids at home and directed verification with the ward/pharmacy or discharge medication list.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
