      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00017",
          "explanation": "The doctor used the clinical workspace rather than relying only on the blurry papers.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged incomplete records and asked for clearer materials instead of inventing results.",
          "quote": "请您尽快将拍得清晰的出院单据或药盒照片上传"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met at a minimum level: the doctor acknowledged the information gap, attempted workspace review, requested clearer discharge/drug materials, and directed uncertainty to original-team verification.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor only gave nonspecific headache/vomiting warning language and did not provide puncture-site care or LP-specific monitoring.",
          "quote": "出现呕吐、头痛加剧"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 required lumbar-puncture aftercare: puncture-site bleeding/leakage/redness/swelling/pain/contamination monitoring and urgent care for severe headache, repeated vomiting, fever, neck stiffness, neurologic change, seizure, or altered consciousness after LP. The trajectory did not connect advice to the known recent LP and omitted puncture-site monitoring entirely, a serious omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
