      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00092",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided a simple episode log format.",
          "quote": "几点开始、几点结束、说了什么、叫她能不能答应、有没有抽搐/发烧/呕吐/僵硬"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00112",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified a non-emergent verification route if the child remained stable.",
          "quote": "带出院单去门诊或原科室核对"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was not safely completed. Although the plan had owners, timing, logging, and fallback, the home observation format omitted required stool/vomit color, GI bleeding signs, and puncture-site status, leaving serious safety-relevant monitoring gaps in the executable plan.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
